error BYN2743: `<` cannot be applied to a value of type parameter `T`

  1 │ T max<T>(T a, T b) => a < b ? b : a;
    │                       ^^^^^
    │
  help: type parameters have no constraints: a `T` can only be copied, compared with `==` and `!=`, passed, stored, returned and formatted

error BYN2743: `>=` cannot be applied to a value of type parameter `T`

  2 │ bool atLeast<T>(T? a, T b) => a >= b;
    │                               ^^^^^^
    │
  help: type parameters have no constraints: a `T` can only be copied, compared with `==` and `!=`, passed, stored, returned and formatted
